WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.517 --> 00:00:03.347
(whooshing)

00:00:03.347 --> 00:00:05.707
- Hello Believe Nation, I
made the Mentor Me series

00:00:05.707 --> 00:00:08.095
to try to hang around people
who've done a lot more

00:00:08.095 --> 00:00:10.557
than us and hopefully by
spending a little more time

00:00:10.557 --> 00:00:13.436
with them some of their
mindsets, attitudes, beliefs,

00:00:13.436 --> 00:00:16.797
way of thinking seep into us
to help us become the best

00:00:16.797 --> 00:00:18.205
version of ourselves.

00:00:18.205 --> 00:00:20.196
So today we're going to
learn from Bob Proctor on how

00:00:20.196 --> 00:00:22.245
to change your paradigm.

00:00:22.245 --> 00:00:23.386
Mentor me, Bob.

00:00:23.386 --> 00:00:25.385
And as always, as Bob is
talking, if he says something

00:00:25.385 --> 00:00:27.757
that really resonates with
you, please leave it in the

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:29.797
comments below and put quotes
around it so other people

00:00:29.797 --> 00:00:31.736
can be inspired as well.

00:00:31.736 --> 00:00:32.738
Enjoy.

00:00:32.738 --> 00:00:35.321
(upbeat music)

00:00:45.616 --> 00:00:48.033
(soft music)

00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:51.035
- When you're going ahead,
the only thing you can measure

00:00:51.035 --> 00:00:53.038
is what you're giving up.

00:00:53.038 --> 00:00:54.886
What about what's coming?

00:00:54.886 --> 00:00:57.266
Well know what's coming? What you want.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:59.095
But you've got to be
able to pay the price.

00:00:59.095 --> 00:01:01.151
You've got to have guts,
if you don't got guts,

00:01:01.151 --> 00:01:02.901
you don't deserve it.

00:01:04.908 --> 00:01:07.117
- [Narrator] The opposite
of courage in our society

00:01:07.117 --> 00:01:09.085
is not cowardice.

00:01:09.085 --> 00:01:10.502
It is conformity.

00:01:11.645 --> 00:01:14.104
And there you have the
trouble today is conformity.

00:01:14.104 --> 00:01:16.316
People all do like everyone
else without knowing why,

00:01:16.316 --> 00:01:19.316
without knowing where they're going.

00:01:22.205 --> 00:01:25.014
- It was like a bucket of
ice water got dumped on my

00:01:25.014 --> 00:01:27.255
head and I started really wondering,

00:01:27.255 --> 00:01:29.525
is here something bigger?

00:01:29.525 --> 00:01:31.046
Is there something more?

00:01:31.046 --> 00:01:34.654
And then Bob kept saying, in
a way that only he can say,

00:01:34.654 --> 00:01:38.113
"What do you want? What
do you really want?"

00:01:38.113 --> 00:01:41.524
And he said, "Don't think about
what you think you can have"

00:01:41.524 --> 00:01:44.345
he said, "Most people are
extras in their own movie.

00:01:44.345 --> 00:01:46.435
"What do you really want?"

00:01:46.435 --> 00:01:49.326
If you believed you could
have absolutely anything,

00:01:49.326 --> 00:01:51.653
do what ever you want,
be whoever you wanted,

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:53.070
what do you want?

00:01:58.155 --> 00:02:00.970
- Regardless of the
intellectual or physical abuse

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:02.825
you're subjected to, no
one can cause you to think

00:02:02.825 --> 00:02:05.083
something you don't want to think!

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:07.754
You've got absolute
control over your thinking.

00:02:07.754 --> 00:02:11.706
No one can change you if you
don't want to be changed.

00:02:11.706 --> 00:02:14.289
(upbeat music)

00:02:23.044 --> 00:02:25.215
Life is very short.

00:02:25.215 --> 00:02:27.015
You're not here for a long time,

00:02:27.015 --> 00:02:29.354
you're only here for a short time.

00:02:29.354 --> 00:02:33.165
Every one of us are hardwired
to do something phenomenal

00:02:33.165 --> 00:02:34.665
with our life.

00:02:34.665 --> 00:02:36.944
We're God's highest form
of creation and we should

00:02:36.944 --> 00:02:38.194
start thinking.

00:02:40.145 --> 00:02:42.978
(soft piano tune)

00:02:58.794 --> 00:03:01.894
I'm going to share some
information with you that,

00:03:01.894 --> 00:03:04.494
it could change the direction
of your life like night

00:03:04.494 --> 00:03:05.603
and day.

00:03:05.603 --> 00:03:09.745
And when I say that, I want
you to really stop and take

00:03:09.745 --> 00:03:11.655
a look at your life.

00:03:11.655 --> 00:03:14.023
Take an honest look at your life.

00:03:14.023 --> 00:03:17.605
I was thinking just before
I started to make this,

00:03:17.605 --> 00:03:21.294
we have actually been conditioned
to kid with ourselves,

00:03:21.294 --> 00:03:25.461
to lie to ourselves, to not
really take an honest look

00:03:27.854 --> 00:03:30.324
at the results we're getting.

00:03:30.324 --> 00:03:34.384
I want you to take a real
honest look at your results.

00:03:34.384 --> 00:03:37.760
And when you look at them, ask yourself,

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:41.427
"Am I living the way I
really want to live?"

00:03:42.665 --> 00:03:44.706
You see, most people aren't.

00:03:44.706 --> 00:03:46.795
One of the first questions
I ask a person that comes

00:03:46.795 --> 00:03:49.274
to work with me, I want to
know what's the most they've

00:03:49.274 --> 00:03:51.286
ever earned in a year.

00:03:51.286 --> 00:03:53.454
I really don't care what the answer is,

00:03:53.454 --> 00:03:55.674
but I want to know what the answer is.

00:03:55.674 --> 00:03:59.841
Because, you see, if a
person says the most they've

00:04:01.363 --> 00:04:04.303
ever earned in a year is
$50,000 I know where their

00:04:04.303 --> 00:04:06.364
mind is programmed.

00:04:06.364 --> 00:04:10.233
If they tell me the most
they've ever earned is $250,000

00:04:10.233 --> 00:04:13.504
I know where they're programmed.

00:04:13.504 --> 00:04:17.065
And then I want to find
out what they want.

00:04:17.065 --> 00:04:20.065
And I know, then, what has to shift.

00:04:21.634 --> 00:04:23.825
Because their mind is
programmed and if they're really

00:04:23.825 --> 00:04:26.284
going to live the way they want to live,

00:04:26.284 --> 00:04:29.117
they've got to change the program.

00:04:30.463 --> 00:04:32.193
And if they don't change the program,

00:04:32.193 --> 00:04:34.295
then nothing really happens.

00:04:34.295 --> 00:04:37.215
Do you know that the law of
attraction is always working,

00:04:37.215 --> 00:04:38.773
it's like the law of gravity.

00:04:38.773 --> 00:04:41.534
If I let this go, it's going to go down.

00:04:41.534 --> 00:04:44.053
It's never going to go back
up, it's going to go down.

00:04:44.053 --> 00:04:45.385
That is the law of gravity.

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:47.254
Anything heavier than
earth is attracted toward

00:04:47.254 --> 00:04:48.415
the center of the world.

00:04:48.415 --> 00:04:50.923
Well the law of
attraction's always working.

00:04:50.923 --> 00:04:52.923
Now, how does it work?

00:04:52.923 --> 00:04:56.423
Well, I use a diagram to explain the mind.

00:04:57.364 --> 00:05:00.364
Let this circle represent your mind.

00:05:01.715 --> 00:05:06.393
And let this little circle
here represent your body.

00:05:06.393 --> 00:05:09.334
Now I want you to think
of this for a moment.

00:05:09.334 --> 00:05:11.926
Your body is a molecular structure.

00:05:11.926 --> 00:05:14.404
This is a mass of energy
at a very high speed of

00:05:14.404 --> 00:05:15.783
vibration.

00:05:15.783 --> 00:05:18.134
If you looked at your
body through a microscope,

00:05:18.134 --> 00:05:21.454
you'd see that energy dancing
right before your eyes.

00:05:21.454 --> 00:05:23.205
And here's something that'll
keep you thinking for the

00:05:23.205 --> 00:05:25.564
next 20 years, when you move out of it,

00:05:25.564 --> 00:05:27.605
the body does not stop moving.

00:05:27.605 --> 00:05:30.673
If you go to a funeral parlor
and pick up the remains

00:05:30.673 --> 00:05:33.064
and look at it, you will see it moving.

00:05:33.064 --> 00:05:35.804
And if it wasn't moving how
would it ever change to dust?

00:05:35.804 --> 00:05:39.255
You move into your body and
you will move out of it.

00:05:39.255 --> 00:05:42.024
And it's how you use your
mind that's going to dictate

00:05:42.024 --> 00:05:43.984
the vibration you're in.

00:05:43.984 --> 00:05:45.623
Stay with me.

00:05:45.623 --> 00:05:48.665
You have an imaginary
line right across here

00:05:48.665 --> 00:05:52.604
and that separates the
conscious mind from the

00:05:52.604 --> 00:05:54.104
subconscious mind.

00:05:55.234 --> 00:05:58.493
Now, the subconscious
mind has been programmed.

00:05:58.493 --> 00:06:01.805
When you were a little baby
this is the way it was.

00:06:01.805 --> 00:06:04.533
You were just like this.

00:06:04.533 --> 00:06:07.163
Subconscious mind wide open
and everything that was

00:06:07.163 --> 00:06:10.263
going on around it went right in there.

00:06:10.263 --> 00:06:13.186
And all the energy that
went in there when you were

00:06:13.186 --> 00:06:17.493
just a little baby formed
something called a paradigm.

00:06:17.493 --> 00:06:19.660
A paradigm is information.

00:06:20.854 --> 00:06:22.674
It's a multitude of habits.

00:06:22.674 --> 00:06:24.633
You are the product of your environment,

00:06:24.633 --> 00:06:27.425
but prior to that you are a
product of a genetic strain

00:06:27.425 --> 00:06:29.445
that goes back for generations.

00:06:29.445 --> 00:06:33.612
Now I'm going to say that the
paradigm is X type energy.

00:06:34.565 --> 00:06:37.265
Now you've got the ability
here on a conscious level

00:06:37.265 --> 00:06:38.864
to think.

00:06:38.864 --> 00:06:42.614
And you can think anything
you want to think.

00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:46.843
And as you think you build ideas.

00:06:46.843 --> 00:06:49.493
There's a power that's flowing
into your consciousness,

00:06:49.493 --> 00:06:50.744
it never stops.

00:06:50.744 --> 00:06:52.294
It flows to and through you.

00:06:52.294 --> 00:06:55.754
You can actually photograph
this power leaving you.

00:06:55.754 --> 00:06:57.745
It flows to and through you.

00:06:57.745 --> 00:07:01.425
Now, as it flows in, you will
start thinking and you'll

00:07:01.425 --> 00:07:03.715
probably think X type thoughts.

00:07:03.715 --> 00:07:07.543
Therefore you're going to
be in an X type vibration.

00:07:07.543 --> 00:07:10.545
And that will produce X type results.

00:07:10.545 --> 00:07:13.424
Now it's the results you want to change.

00:07:13.424 --> 00:07:15.595
And to change the results
you're going to have to change

00:07:15.595 --> 00:07:16.805
what you attract.

00:07:16.805 --> 00:07:19.624
You see, the thoughts
that you think control the

00:07:19.624 --> 00:07:21.275
vibration that you're in.

00:07:21.275 --> 00:07:24.578
Vibration is nothing but an
idea, it's a law of the universe

00:07:24.578 --> 00:07:27.365
everything vibrates, nothing rests.

00:07:27.365 --> 00:07:29.573
We live in an ocean of motion.

00:07:29.573 --> 00:07:31.594
And it's the thoughts that
you're thinking that you

00:07:31.594 --> 00:07:34.673
impress upon your subconscious
mind that control the

00:07:34.673 --> 00:07:39.105
vibration the body's in and
that dictates how you act,

00:07:39.105 --> 00:07:43.087
but it also dictates what you attract.

00:07:43.087 --> 00:07:45.923
You attract energy that's
in harmony with you.

00:07:45.923 --> 00:07:48.535
You attract people that
are in harmony with you.

00:07:48.535 --> 00:07:50.805
You see, everything
operates on frequencies.

00:07:50.805 --> 00:07:53.713
There's an infinite number of frequencies,

00:07:53.713 --> 00:07:55.795
but you and I operate on the frequency,

00:07:55.795 --> 00:07:57.844
just like a radio station does.

00:07:57.844 --> 00:08:01.364
And the only music you can
attract is the music that is

00:08:01.364 --> 00:08:04.125
tuned in to the vibration you're in.

00:08:04.125 --> 00:08:06.284
Now it's the paradigm
that's been controlling the

00:08:06.284 --> 00:08:07.117
vibration.

00:08:08.034 --> 00:08:10.713
You can change your thinking
but that doesn't do anything,

00:08:10.713 --> 00:08:12.884
you've got to change the paradigm.

00:08:12.884 --> 00:08:15.383
And if you don't change the
paradigm nothing happens.

00:08:15.383 --> 00:08:18.594
Now, talking about paradigms
is another subject,

00:08:18.594 --> 00:08:20.393
we'll do that at another time.

00:08:20.393 --> 00:08:23.725
But it's the thoughts that
you think that control

00:08:23.725 --> 00:08:26.024
the vibration you're in
and that dictates what you

00:08:26.024 --> 00:08:26.857
attract.

00:08:26.857 --> 00:08:29.643
So if you keep attracting
what you don't want,

00:08:29.643 --> 00:08:32.543
understand this, it's the
paradigm that's causing

00:08:32.543 --> 00:08:33.974
the problem.

00:08:33.974 --> 00:08:37.753
You can think a Y type thought
which is totally different

00:08:37.753 --> 00:08:40.095
than the X type conditioning,
it isn't going to go

00:08:40.095 --> 00:08:41.384
anywhere.

00:08:41.384 --> 00:08:43.744
Because when you go to
get emotionally involved,

00:08:43.744 --> 00:08:45.805
and this is the emotional mind.

00:08:45.805 --> 00:08:48.544
When you go to get emotionally
involved with that Y type

00:08:48.544 --> 00:08:50.823
thought, the paradigm will kick it out.

00:08:50.823 --> 00:08:51.865
You know why?

00:08:51.865 --> 00:08:54.103
It's so uncomfortable.

00:08:54.103 --> 00:08:56.213
That's stepping out of the
box, that's doing things

00:08:56.213 --> 00:08:58.503
different and we don't
like to do things different

00:08:58.503 --> 00:09:00.973
