00:09:00.973 --> 00:09:03.553
But understand this, the
paradigm and the thinking

00:09:03.553 --> 00:09:06.035
control the vibration
you're in and the vibration

00:09:06.035 --> 00:09:09.425
you're in is going to
dictate what you attract.

00:09:09.425 --> 00:09:12.656
People that are in a poverty
consciousness will continue

00:09:12.656 --> 00:09:15.314
to attract lack of limitation.

00:09:15.314 --> 00:09:17.924
It has nothing to do with this,

00:09:17.924 --> 00:09:18.823
what's going on here.

00:09:18.823 --> 00:09:21.624
This is your educated mind
and you can gather all kinds

00:09:21.624 --> 00:09:22.806
