00:09:22.806 --> 00:09:25.485
Have you ever wondered why
some people have such an

00:09:25.485 --> 00:09:28.213
educated mind, they have
degrees coming right off the

00:09:28.213 --> 00:09:30.935
end of their business card,
but it doesn't show up

00:09:30.935 --> 00:09:32.602
in the results. Why?

00:09:33.565 --> 00:09:34.398
Paradigm.

00:09:36.015 --> 00:09:38.633
The law of attraction.

00:09:38.633 --> 00:09:40.583
You've got to change this.

00:09:40.583 --> 00:09:42.635
You've got to change
the vibration you're in

00:09:42.635 --> 00:09:44.275
and your whole world changes.

00:09:44.275 --> 00:09:47.692
Listen, in 1961, a man gave me this book.

00:09:48.783 --> 00:09:51.285
And he said, "Do exactly what I tell you."

00:09:51.285 --> 00:09:55.093
He was giving me Y type
ideas, it caused an enormous

00:09:55.093 --> 00:09:59.333
amount of discomfort, but
I did exactly what he said.

00:09:59.333 --> 00:10:00.764
And you know something?

00:10:00.764 --> 00:10:04.285
My income went from 4,000
to 170,000 in a year

00:10:04.285 --> 00:10:07.185
and then I took over a million.

00:10:07.185 --> 00:10:09.614
It took me nine and a
half years to figure out

00:10:09.614 --> 00:10:10.781
what happened.

00:10:11.774 --> 00:10:13.773
This is why I'm showing you.

00:10:13.773 --> 00:10:15.724
Watch this over and over and over again.

00:10:15.724 --> 00:10:17.846
There's a number of lessons in here.

00:10:17.846 --> 00:10:21.154
When the paradigms
change, your life changes.

00:10:21.154 --> 00:10:22.794
It's a beautiful concept.

00:10:22.794 --> 00:10:25.183
It's an absolutely phenomenal concept.

00:10:25.183 --> 00:10:27.035
Now you know why you're
getting the results

00:10:27.035 --> 00:10:27.868
you're getting.

00:10:27.868 --> 00:10:29.705
It has nothing to do with your intellect,

00:10:29.705 --> 00:10:32.085
your intellect you can
figure out how to do things.

00:10:32.085 --> 00:10:33.905
That doesn't mean you're going to do them.

00:10:33.905 --> 00:10:35.644
You'll hear people say, "I believe that,"

00:10:35.644 --> 00:10:37.225
but their behavior would
indicate they've never even

00:10:37.225 --> 00:10:38.195
heard of it.

00:10:38.195 --> 00:10:39.696
Why?

00:10:39.696 --> 00:10:41.495
We believe something on a conscious level,

00:10:41.495 --> 00:10:43.573
on a subconscious level
the paradigm believes

00:10:43.573 --> 00:10:44.763
something else.

00:10:44.763 --> 00:10:46.394
There's a word called praxis.

00:10:46.394 --> 00:10:49.105
Praxis is the integration
of belief with behavior.

00:10:49.105 --> 00:10:52.304
We've got to take the beliefs
that we have consciously,

00:10:52.304 --> 00:10:56.083
that we determine by
thinking, and plant them

00:10:56.083 --> 00:10:57.885
in the place of the old belief.

00:10:57.885 --> 00:11:00.364
See, I used to believe
that I couldn't do anything

00:11:00.364 --> 00:11:02.193
better than I was doing.

00:11:02.193 --> 00:11:05.255
I felt fortunate that I
was on the fire department.

00:11:05.255 --> 00:11:06.953
The idea of building a
company that operated all

00:11:06.953 --> 00:11:10.154
around the world, furthest
thing from my mind.

00:11:10.154 --> 00:11:11.606
But you know something?

00:11:11.606 --> 00:11:14.673
As I changed my paradigm,
my whole world changed.

00:11:14.673 --> 00:11:16.554
That's what we do.

00:11:16.554 --> 00:11:18.264
That's what it's all about.

00:11:18.264 --> 00:11:20.525
You've got to change your
paradigm if you want to

00:11:20.525 --> 00:11:21.863
change your life.

00:11:21.863 --> 00:11:24.205
You can study all you
want, if you don't gain an

00:11:24.205 --> 00:11:26.513
understanding how to alter that program,

00:11:26.513 --> 00:11:28.904
and that's what the
paradigm is, it's a program.

00:11:28.904 --> 00:11:31.113
It's a multitude of concepts
that are fixed in your

00:11:31.113 --> 00:11:33.215
subconscious mind that literally control

00:11:33.215 --> 00:11:34.915
your behavior.

00:11:34.915 --> 00:11:38.384
It's a beautiful concept to understand.

00:11:38.384 --> 00:11:40.784
It's a terrible one if
you don't understand it.

00:11:40.784 --> 00:11:42.633
Because it literally controls your life.

00:11:42.633 --> 00:11:44.758
Why do you think most people
go right through their life

00:11:44.758 --> 00:11:47.814
and keep getting the same
results year after year

00:11:47.814 --> 00:11:48.731
after year?

00:11:49.884 --> 00:11:53.465
Well, it's just the way
it is and they don't know.

00:11:53.465 --> 00:11:56.774
We should be taught this
in school, but we're not.

00:11:56.774 --> 00:11:58.214
How is the paradigm formed?

00:11:58.214 --> 00:12:00.103
Through the repetition of information.

00:12:00.103 --> 00:12:01.473
How is the paradigm changed?

00:12:01.473 --> 00:12:03.383
Repetition of information.

00:12:03.383 --> 00:12:05.984
Now let's suppose you're
having a difficult time

00:12:05.984 --> 00:12:07.255
with money.

00:12:07.255 --> 00:12:10.285
You find that you've got more
going out than coming in.

00:12:10.285 --> 00:12:12.915
You've got to change
your concept about money.

00:12:12.915 --> 00:12:13.995
How do you do that?

00:12:13.995 --> 00:12:15.815
Through the repetition of an idea.

00:12:15.815 --> 00:12:17.663
That's where affirmation comes in.

00:12:17.663 --> 00:12:20.293
I'll give you one I've
been using for years.

00:12:20.293 --> 00:12:23.843
I'm so happy and grateful
now that money comes to me

00:12:23.843 --> 00:12:26.803
in increasing quantities
through multiple sources

00:12:26.803 --> 00:12:28.623
on a continuous basis.

00:12:28.623 --> 00:12:32.234
I am so happy and grateful
now that money comes to me

00:12:32.234 --> 00:12:35.015
in increasing quantities
through multiple sources

00:12:35.015 --> 00:12:36.848
on a continuous basis.

00:12:38.695 --> 00:12:40.425
You don't just say that once or twice,

00:12:40.425 --> 00:12:42.605
you've got to repeat that
maybe a thousand times a day

00:12:42.605 --> 00:12:45.423
every day for maybe 90 days
and you'll start to change

00:12:45.423 --> 00:12:47.373
your whole concept about money.

00:12:47.373 --> 00:12:50.865
Wealthy people all have
multiple sources of income.

00:12:50.865 --> 00:12:53.675
Now I'm going to tell
you what happened to me.

00:12:53.675 --> 00:12:57.593
I drove around with a battery
operated record player

00:12:57.593 --> 00:13:02.379
and a long playing record
and I played it over and over

00:13:02.379 --> 00:13:05.653
again every day for
probably a couple of years.

00:13:05.653 --> 00:13:09.514
It was so totally
illogical, it was behavior,

00:13:09.514 --> 00:13:11.554
everybody thought I was losing it.

00:13:11.554 --> 00:13:13.864
And I'm reading the same book every day,

00:13:13.864 --> 00:13:14.993
Think and Grow Rich.

00:13:14.993 --> 00:13:19.034
As a matter of fact, I'm
still reading the same book.

00:13:19.034 --> 00:13:23.863
And it was the repetition
of Romant Gail's information

00:13:23.863 --> 00:13:26.104
and the book that changed the paradigm.

00:13:26.104 --> 00:13:28.145
I didn't know what I was
doing, I didn't understand what

00:13:28.145 --> 00:13:30.824
I was doing, but I did it.

00:13:30.824 --> 00:13:33.433
Do you know, I had a man
come up to me in the Waldorf

00:13:33.433 --> 00:13:36.365
Hotel in New York, Waldorf Historia.

00:13:36.365 --> 00:13:38.985
At the end of a three
day program and he said,

00:13:38.985 --> 00:13:41.743
"Bob, I really want to thank
you for what you've just

00:13:41.743 --> 00:13:43.104
"given to me."

00:13:43.104 --> 00:13:46.245
He said, "For the first time
in my life I've understood

00:13:46.245 --> 00:13:49.284
"how I accomplished what I did."

00:13:49.284 --> 00:13:50.685
I said, "What did you do?"

00:13:50.685 --> 00:13:53.544
He said, "I won the gold
medal in the decathlon in

00:13:53.544 --> 00:13:57.461
"the Olympics in Melbourne,
Australia in 1957."

00:13:58.334 --> 00:13:59.924
That's right.

00:13:59.924 --> 00:14:01.503
Milt Campbell.

00:14:01.503 --> 00:14:03.744
And he said, "I never
understood how I did it."

00:14:03.744 --> 00:14:05.465
He said, "The next time
you run a seminar I want to

00:14:05.465 --> 00:14:07.584
"bring my boys," and he did.

00:14:07.584 --> 00:14:09.015
Milt and I became great friends.

00:14:09.015 --> 00:14:10.745
In fact, Milt has a key to our house.

00:14:10.745 --> 00:14:12.736
He can come stay there anytime he wants.

00:14:12.736 --> 00:14:15.644
I live in Toronto, he's in New Jersey.

00:14:15.644 --> 00:14:17.815
But he was the top athlete in the world,

00:14:17.815 --> 00:14:20.253
best athlete in the world,
he didn't understand how he

00:14:20.253 --> 00:14:21.365
got there.

00:14:21.365 --> 00:14:24.113
Most people that are very
accomplished cannot tell you

00:14:24.113 --> 00:14:24.946
why they are.

00:14:24.946 --> 00:14:26.084
That's why they are.

00:14:26.084 --> 00:14:28.194
They've rewritten the program,
they changed the paradigm,

00:14:28.194 --> 00:14:30.064
they might not of
understood how they did it,

00:14:30.064 --> 00:14:31.425
but they did it.

00:14:31.425 --> 00:14:33.024
That's what our company is all about.

00:14:33.024 --> 00:14:35.335
We teach people how to change paradigms.

00:14:35.335 --> 00:14:37.485
I want to thank you for watching this.

00:14:37.485 --> 00:14:40.626
But I'm going to ask you to
share it with other people.

00:14:40.626 --> 00:14:41.595
Share it with them.

00:14:41.595 --> 00:14:43.424
Say, "Come and watch this."

00:14:43.424 --> 00:14:47.881
Start a rapport, build a
rapport with people, you know?

00:14:47.881 --> 00:14:50.561
It's a great way to live.

00:14:50.561 --> 00:14:54.543
And this is great
information to understand.

00:14:54.543 --> 00:14:56.711
Thanks for listening, this is Bob Proctor.

00:14:56.711 --> 00:14:58.632
I enjoy sharing it with you.

00:14:58.632 --> 00:15:00.121
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:15:00.121 --> 00:15:01.062
I hope you enjoyed.

00:15:01.062 --> 00:15:02.963
I'd love to know, what did
you think of the video?

00:15:02.963 --> 00:15:04.530
What did you think about Bob's message?

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:06.202
What impact is it going to have?

00:15:06.202 --> 00:15:08.002
What changes are you going
to make in your life or your

00:15:08.002 --> 00:15:09.691
business after watching this?

00:15:09.691 --> 00:15:11.151
What was your favorite clip?

